ikou crescendo no mukou he

01:37:45.600 --> 01:37:51.040
Going beyond the crescendo

01:37:51.040 --> 01:37:54.800
tsumadzuitemo ii

01:37:51.040 --> 01:37:54.800
Don't be afraid to stumble

01:37:54.800 --> 01:37:58.140
hamidashitemo ii

01:37:54.800 --> 01:37:58.140
Don't be afraid to stand out

