01:39:32.680 --> 01:39:38.720
When all our hearts can sing in harmony

01:39:38.720 --> 01:39:45.890
ima hajimaru seishun no prelude

01:39:38.720 --> 01:39:45.890
That's when it will start, our youth's prelude

